{"connection_id": "BC-a9cba03144a4586c8fdf", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.4.21", "target": "sec9", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "love of God entails love of brother", "note": "The commentary binds faith to affection among companions; John says the command received from God is that the one loving God must also love his brother."}

