{"connection_id": "BC-ddd76771178f3e344164", "ref": "SBLGNT:2Tim.2.24", "target": "sec9", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "God's servant avoids quarrels", "note": "The commentary reverses rival claims into patient counsel; this instruction says the Lord's servant must not quarrel but be kind to everyone and able to teach."}
