+{"connection_id":"BC-4f2c75b356ddd0ee4973","ref":"SBLGNT:1Cor.6.8","status":"rejected","reason":"Verse 8 accuses the litigants of fraud, a further moral indictment; paragraph 26's selected point is that litigation itself marks loss in verse 7.","paragraphs":[26],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1Cor.6.8"],"annotations":[]}
+{"connection_id":"BC-4bbe946307f9402a5ecd","ref":"SBLGNT:1John.1.7","status":"rejected","reason":"Walking in light and fellowship is broad; it does not explicitly join truth-speaking to reciprocal instruction as Eph 4:25 does.","paragraphs":[27],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1John.1.7"],"annotations":[]}
