+{"connection_id":"BC-9f5765ded3cbfbab29cb","ref":"SBLGNT:1John.3.16","status":"rejected","reason":"The Christological self-sacrifice command is more specific than this section's mutual advice and social peace, and would shift its focus.","paragraphs":[27],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1John.3.16"],"annotations":[]}
+{"connection_id":"BC-767ceba15bf8aaaf5243","ref":"SBLGNT:1John.3.17","status":"rejected","reason":"The needy brother scene concerns material resources, but paragraph 27 invokes poor feeding as a negative Qur'anic comparison to exhortation, not its central scene.","paragraphs":[27],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1John.3.17"],"annotations":[]}
+{"connection_id":"BC-5b9e658c7876bebde582","ref":"SBLGNT:1John.3.18","status":"rejected","reason":"Love in deed and truth parallels the surah's virtues, but it does not specify the reciprocal giving and receiving of counsel that Eph 4:25 and Heb 10:24 express.","paragraphs":[27],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1John.3.18"],"annotations":[]}
