{"connection_id":"BC-4bbe946307f9402a5ecd","ref":"SBLGNT:1John.1.7","status":"rejected","reason":"Walking in light and fellowship is broad; it does not explicitly join truth-speaking to reciprocal instruction as Eph 4:25 does.","paragraphs":[27],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1John.1.7"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-f200070e18e1fac67d60","ref":"SBLGNT:1John.3.14","status":"rejected","reason":"The passage contrasts love and death, whereas the section's loss is linked to quarrel and counsel, not mortality; Eccl 4:10 fits its solitary image more closely.","paragraphs":[27],"evidence":["SBLGNT:1John.3.14"],"annotations":[]}
