+{"connection_id":"BC-2cb11aac68c15905be40","ref":"WLC:Prov.25.15","status":"rejected","reason":"Patience persuades a ruler and a gentle tongue breaks bone; its ruler-persuasion focus differs from paragraph 28's peer reconciliation, while Prov 15:18 directly stills a quarrel.","paragraphs":[28],"evidence":["WLC:Prov.25.15"],"annotations":[]}
